parameters.text:
=Generate 3 improved versions of this prompt, each using a different optimization strategy.

Goal: {{ $json.config.task_goal }}
Original Prompt: {{ $json.config.original_prompt }}
Weaknesses identified: {{ JSON.stringify($json.analysis.weaknesses) }}
Improvement strategies: {{ JSON.stringify($json.analysis.improvement_strategies) }}

Version 1: Fix all weaknesses, add clear output format
Version 2: Add role definition + few-shot example
Version 3: Chain-of-thought approach — ask model to think step by step

For each version also run the prompt mentally and estimate the quality of output.

Return JSON:
{
  "variants": [
    {
      "version": 1,
      "strategy": "structured with output format",
      "prompt": "full improved prompt text",
      "improvements_made": [],
      "predicted_score": 0,
      "best_for": ""
    }
  ],
  "recommended_version": 1,
  "recommendation_reason": ""
}

parameters.jsCode:
const raw = $input.item.json.text.replace(/```json|```/g,'').trim();
const variants = JSON.parse(raw);
return [{ json: { ...variants, original_analysis: $('Parse Analysis').item.json.analysis, original_prompt: $('Set Optimization Config').item.json.original_prompt } }];
